IF THIS HAS OCCURED THE VALUES DERIVED FROM THE OPTION SWITCHES BECOME THE DEFAULT SETTINGS FOR THAT RUN.
THE ".RESET COMMAND RESTORES THE CURRENT DEFAULT SETTINGS OF THE ABOVE LIST.

